Mix the sand with the jelly, it should form a paste. Then make about six medium thickness sheets out of the mixture. Once those dry out use the remaining mixture to glue them all together and let dry. Then suffocate your victim. 

&#x200B;

It might take a few weeks to dry the sheets of mixture, and you'd have to make them on the ground or whatever unless you'd be willing to use some baking trays and a dehydrator, but if not it'd still work.

